---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
	title="Class 9 Linear Equations in Two Variables | Mathematics | The Concepts Adda"
	description="Learn Class 9 Linear Equations in Two Variables (Latest NCERT) through clear lessons, ax + by + c = 0 form, solutions, and graphing."
>
	<main class="ch-page">
		<section class="ch-hero">
			<div class="ch-container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/class-9">← Back to Class 9</a>
					<span class="breadcrumb-dot"></span>
					<span class="breadcrumb-class">CLASS 9 MATHEMATICS</span>
				</div>
				<h1>Master <span class="blue-text">Linear Equations in Two Variables.</span></h1>
				<p class="hero-description">
					Build a solid foundation in Linear Equations according to the latest NCERT syllabus through ax + by + c = 0 standard form, finding infinitely many solutions, and graphing linear equations.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="learning-section">
			<div class="ch-container">
				<div class="learning-heading">
					<div class="section-label">CHAPTER 04 · LINEAR EQUATIONS IN TWO VARIABLES</div>
					<div class="heading-row">
						<h2>Your learning <span class="blue-text">path.</span></h2>
						<p>Follow the lessons in order and build your concepts step by step.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="lesson-list">
					<!-- LESSON 01 -->
					<a href="/class-9/linear-equations/standard-form-solutions" class="lesson-card">
						<div class="lesson-number">01</div>
						<div class="lesson-content">
							<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 01</div>
							<h3>Standard Form ax + by + c = 0 & Solutions</h3>
							<p>Understand linear equations in two variables, writing in ax + by + c = 0 form, and finding solutions (infinitely many solutions).</p>
						</div>
						<div class="lesson-arrow">→</div>
					</a>

					<!-- LESSON 02 -->
					<a href="/class-9/linear-equations/graph-of-linear-equation" class="lesson-card">
						<div class="lesson-number">02</div>
						<div class="lesson-content">
							<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 02</div>
							<h3>Graph of a Linear Equation in Two Variables</h3>
							<p>Master plotting straight lines on Cartesian plane, equations of lines parallel to axes (x = a, y = b), and word problems.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="lesson-arrow">→</div>
					</a>

					<!-- LESSON 03 -->
					<a href="/class-9/linear-equations/pyqs" class="lesson-card">
						<div class="lesson-number">03</div>
						<div class="lesson-content">
							<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 03 · PRACTICE</div>
							<h3>Previous Year Questions (PYQs)</h3>
							<p>Practice exam questions and practice problems organized by year and marks for self-assessment.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="lesson-arrow">→</div>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<style>
		.ch-page { min-height: 100vh; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #ffffff 40%, #f7f9fc 100%); color: #14213d; }
		.ch-container { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
		.ch-hero { padding: 55px 0 45px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef4ff 0%, rgba(238, 244, 255, 0) 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
		.breadcrumb { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; }
		.breadcrumb a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }
		.breadcrumb-dot { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: #94a3b8; }
		.ch-hero h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.8vw, 56px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -2px; font-weight: 900; }
		.blue-text { color: #2563eb; }
		.hero-description { margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 700px; color: #64748b; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
		.learning-section { padding: 60px 0 100px; }
		.section-label { color: #2563eb; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1.8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
		.heading-row h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px); letter-spacing: -1.5px; font-weight: 900; }
		.heading-row p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 16px; }
		.lesson-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-top: 35px; }
		.lesson-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px minmax(0, 1fr) 24px; gap: 24px; align-items: center; padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e1e7f0; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: all 0.2s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.03); }
		.lesson-card:hover { border-color: #2563eb; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08); }
		.lesson-number { width: 60px; height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 16px; background: #eef4ff; color: #2563eb; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; }
		.lesson-label { color: #2563eb; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
		.lesson-content h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #14213d; }
		.lesson-content p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
		.lesson-arrow { font-size: 20px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 800; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
		.lesson-card:hover .lesson-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
		@media (max-width: 768px) { .lesson-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 22px; } .lesson-number { width: 50px; height: 50px; font-size: 16px; } }
	</style>
</Layout>
